{"seq":2,"slug":"arithmetic-coding-ans","title":"算术编码与 ANS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/entropy-coding/arithmetic-coding-ans","wordCount":1350,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"算术编码与-ans\">算术编码与 ANS</h1><p><a href=\"huffman-coding\">霍夫曼编码</a>的天花板是整数比特：再聪明的树也没法给一个概率 0.9 的符号分配 0.15 比特。突破这个天花板需要一个完全不同的思路——不再为每个符号单独分配码字，而是把整段消息当作一个数来编码。算术编码做到了这一点，而 ANS 则在保持这种精度的同时把速度拉回了霍夫曼的级别，成为过去十年压缩领域最重要的工程进展。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把消息编成一个区间\">核心概念：把消息编成一个区间</h2><p>算术编码的核心想法是把整条消息映射到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 区间里的一个子区间。开始时区间是整个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。每读入一个符号，就按它的概率把当前区间切成几块，选中对应那一块作为新区间。消息越长，区间越窄；最后只需输出落在最终区间内的任意一个数（取其二进制表示），就唯一确定了整条消息。</p>\n<p>这样做的妙处在于，一个概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的符号会把区间缩小为原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 倍，对应「花费」了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\log_2 p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 比特——这正是<a href=\"../foundations/entropy-redundancy\">熵</a>要求的理想码长，且可以是分数！于是算术编码的平均码长能逼到熵附近，几乎没有霍夫曼那种取整浪费。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;区间 [0,1)&quot;] --&gt; B[读入符号 a&lt;br/&gt;选 a 对应子区间]&#10;    B --&gt; C[区间收窄]&#10;    C --&gt; D[读入符号 b&lt;br/&gt;再切分再选]&#10;    D --&gt; E[区间更窄]&#10;    E --&gt; F[消息结束]&#10;    F --&gt; G[输出区间内一个数&lt;br/&gt;的二进制位]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"区间 [0,1)\"] --&gt; B[读入符号 a&lt;br/&gt;选 a 对应子区间]\n    B --&gt; C[区间收窄]\n    C --&gt; D[读入符号 b&lt;br/&gt;再切分再选]\n    D --&gt; E[区间更窄]\n    E --&gt; F[消息结束]\n    F --&gt; G[输出区间内一个数&lt;br/&gt;的二进制位]</pre><h2 id=\"数学形式与编码过程\">数学形式与编码过程</h2><p>设当前区间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>low</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>high</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\text{low}, \\text{high})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">low</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">high</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，宽度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>range</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>high</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>low</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{range}=\\text{high}-\\text{low}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">range</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">high</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">low</span></span></span></span></span></span>。对累积概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(s)=\\sum_{i&lt;s}p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，读入符号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 后更新为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>low</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext>low</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>range</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msup><mtext>high</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext>low</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>range</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{low}&#x27; = \\text{low} + \\text{range}\\cdot C(s), \\qquad \\text{high}&#x27; = \\text{low} + \\text{range}\\cdot\\big(C(s)+p_s\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8362em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">low</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8362em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">low</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">range</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0862em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">high</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8362em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">low</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">range</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>下表跟踪对消息 <code>ab</code>（设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_a=0.6, p_b=0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span></span></span></span></span>）的编码过程，直观看到区间如何收窄。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>读入</th>\n<th>low</th>\n<th>high</th>\n<th>range</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初始</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>0.0</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>a</td>\n<td>0.0</td>\n<td>0.6</td>\n<td>0.6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>b</td>\n<td>0.36</td>\n<td>0.6</td>\n<td>0.24</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后只要输出一个落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.36</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0.36, 0.6)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.36</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的数（如 0.5，二进制 <code>.1</code>）即可。实际实现用整数定点运算并做增量输出（一旦高位确定就吐出），避免无限精度浮点，这套技术叫范围编码（range coding），是算术编码的工程化身，广泛用于视频编码器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"算术编码的代价与历史包袱\">算术编码的代价与历史包袱</h2><p>算术编码压缩率几乎触及熵，但有两个长期短板。其一是慢：每个符号都涉及乘除法和归一化，比霍夫曼的查表慢得多。其二是历史专利问题——上世纪很多算术编码变体被 IBM 等公司申请了专利，导致 JPEG 标准里算术编码模式虽存在却几乎没人用（大家都用霍夫曼模式），直到专利过期。</p>\n<p>这两个短板让算术编码长期停留在「理论最优、工程不爽」的尴尬位置，也为 ANS 的崛起留下了空间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ans-非对称数系的革命\">ANS：非对称数系的革命</h2><p>2014 年前后，Jarek Duda 提出的非对称数系（Asymmetric Numeral Systems, ANS）改变了格局。ANS 用一个单一的状态整数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 来承载信息：编码一个符号就是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 变换到一个更大的状态，解码则反向把符号「抽」出来。关键在于，它达到了接近算术编码的压缩率，却只需要查表和移位、加法这类廉价操作，速度接近霍夫曼。</p>\n<p>ANS 有几个常用变体。rANS（基于范围的 ANS）类似范围编码，用乘除处理任意概率，灵活。tANS（基于表的 ANS）把状态转移预计算成一张有限状态机表，编码即查表，极快——这正是 <a href=\"../dictionary/modern-compressors\">zstd</a> 里 FSE（Finite State Entropy）的基础。下表对比三种熵编码器。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>熵编码器</th>\n<th>压缩率</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>比特粒度</th>\n<th>典型使用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>霍夫曼</td>\n<td>良（受整数限制）</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>整数比特</td>\n<td>DEFLATE、JPEG</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>算术/范围编码</td>\n<td>优（贴近熵）</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>分数比特</td>\n<td>H.264/H.265 的 CABAC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tANS/rANS</td>\n<td>优（贴近熵）</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>分数比特</td>\n<td>zstd、LZFSE、JPEG XL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"一个反直觉的细节-ans-后进先出\">一个反直觉的细节：ANS 后进先出</h2><p>ANS 有个容易踩坑的特性：它的编码和解码顺序相反。因为状态是一个栈式的整数，最后编码的符号最先被解出来，所以编码端通常要逆序处理符号、解码端正序还原（或反之）。这在流式场景里需要额外缓冲，是 ANS 工程实现里最常见的困惑点。理解了这一点，就能明白为什么 ANS 特别适合块式压缩（如 <a href=\"../dictionary/modern-compressors\">zstd 的块结构</a>），而在严格逐字节流式场景里要做特别处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>算术编码把整条消息编成一个收窄的区间，每符号花费分数比特 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\log_2 p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，几乎触及熵，消除了霍夫曼的取整浪费。</li>\n<li>工程化身是范围编码（整数定点 + 增量输出），广泛用于视频编码器的 CABAC。</li>\n<li>算术编码的短板是慢与历史专利包袱，长期停在「理论最优、工程不爽」。</li>\n<li>ANS（rANS/tANS）用单一状态整数兼得贴近熵的压缩率与接近霍夫曼的速度，是近十年最重要的进展。</li>\n<li>tANS（即 FSE）把状态转移预计算成查表，是 <a href=\"../dictionary/modern-compressors\">zstd</a>、LZFSE、JPEG XL 的熵编码内核。</li>\n<li>注意 ANS 编解码顺序相反的栈式特性，使它天然契合块式压缩。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"算术编码与 ANS","id":"算术编码与-ans"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把消息编成一个区间","id":"核心概念-把消息编成一个区间"},{"level":2,"text":"数学形式与编码过程","id":"数学形式与编码过程"},{"level":2,"text":"算术编码的代价与历史包袱","id":"算术编码的代价与历史包袱"},{"level":2,"text":"ANS：非对称数系的革命","id":"ans-非对称数系的革命"},{"level":2,"text":"一个反直觉的细节：ANS 后进先出","id":"一个反直觉的细节-ans-后进先出"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"霍夫曼编码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/entropy-coding/huffman-coding"},"next":{"title":"游程编码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/entropy-coding/run-length"}}